Avvaiyar's Playworld Privacy Policy
Last updated: 20 July 2026

Avvaiyar's Playworld is a children's story-adventure designed to work without an account and without collecting personal information.

Information we collect
We do not collect names, email addresses, phone numbers, precise or approximate location, contacts, photographs, microphone recordings, advertising identifiers, or gameplay analytics. The app does not contain advertising, in-app purchases, chat, or social features.

Information stored on the device
Episode progress, earned XP, rewards, discoveries, activity checkpoints, and sound or narration choices are stored locally on the device. This information is used only to continue the child's journey. It is not transmitted to us or to third parties. Android Clear storage or uninstalling the app removes this locally stored information, subject to the device platform's normal backup behavior.

Children's privacy
The app is intended for children and families. The app does not create accounts, transmit personal information, display advertising, or ask children to provide personal details.

Third-party services
The current version does not include advertising networks, analytics services, social logins, cloud accounts, or third-party tracking SDKs.

Changes
If a future version introduces an online feature or changes its data practices, this policy and the Google Play disclosures will be updated before that version is released.

Contact
Privacy questions can be sent to rselvaguru@gmail.com.
